[h1]LiveWire + LG Extended Electricity Adapter[/h1]

[b]Project Zomboid Build 42.21 · Mod ID: LiveWireLGEEAdapter[/b]

Keep LiveWire's inverter coverage working when [b]LG Extended Electricity (LGEE)[/b]'s generator-range takeover is enabled. This lightweight compatibility adapter lets LiveWire's inverters continue to provide their normal radius-based power coverage alongside LGEE.

[h2]Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*]Project Zomboid Build 42.21
[*]LiveWire (Mod ID: [code]batman_LiveWire[/code])
[*]LG Extended Electricity (Mod ID: [code]LGExtendedElectricity[/code])
[/list]

The adapter declares both mods as dependencies. Enable them together with this adapter.

[b]This mod is only required if you use both LiveWire and LG Extended Electricity.[/b]

[h2]Installation[/h2]

[list=1]
[*]Subscribe to LiveWire and LG Extended Electricity.
[*]Subscribe to this adapter.
[*]In the Mods menu, enable LiveWire, LG Extended Electricity, and [b]LiveWire + LG Extended Electricity Adapter[/b].
[/list]

For multiplayer, install and enable the adapter on the server and clients. Configure sandbox options on the server.

[h2]Sandbox settings[/h2]

When LGEE's generator-range takeover is active, the adapter offers one setting under [b]LiveWire + LG Extended Electricity[/b]:

[list]
[*][b]LiveWire power range override:[/b] 0–100 tiles
[/list]

The default value [b]0[/b] uses the 20-tile horizontal default. Choose a positive value to override the horizontal range. Vertical reach stays at the default of 3 floors while the takeover is active; there is no vertical override setting. When LGEE's takeover is inactive, LiveWire's original range behavior is left unchanged.

[h2]What this adapter does[/h2]

[list]
[*]Preserves LiveWire's inverter radius coverage while LGEE's generator-range takeover is active.
[*]Integrates coverage through LGEE's relay system automatically. No relay crafting, placement, or wiring is needed for LiveWire.
[*]Keeps coverage limited to LiveWire's configured horizontal radius and 3-floor vertical range while takeover is active; it does not power an entire building.
[*]Avoids missing squares and squares that already contain a generator.
[*]If compatible LGEE coverage APIs are unavailable, logs a warning and leaves LiveWire's original range behavior in place.
[/list]

This adapter works alongside LiveWire and LGEE; it does not replace or modify either mod.

[h2]Troubleshooting[/h2]

[list]
[*]Make sure all three mods are enabled and their Mod IDs match the requirements above.
[*]Range overrides only apply while LGEE's generator-range takeover is active. A value of 0 uses LiveWire's default for that range.
[*]If the adapter reports unsupported coverage APIs, check for a version of LGEE compatible with Build 42.21.
[*]Look in the game log for messages tagged [code][LiveWireLGEEAdapter][/code].
[/list]